| Channel | Utilisation    | Plage                       |
| ------: | -------------- | --------------------------- |
|    0    | Position   X   |  chunk.min.x → chunk.max.x  |
|    1    | Position   Z   |  chunk.min.z → chunk.max.z  |
|    2    | Rotation   Y   |  -180 → 180                 |
|    3    | Scale   X      |  1 → 2                      |
|    4    | Scale   Y      |  1 → 2                      |
|    5    | Scale   Z      |  1 → 2                      |